        "alt": "外套の内側に引き込まれ「今夜いちばんの味だった」と囁かれる瞬間"
      },
      {
        "id": "night-eater.crisis.asset.still.002",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/events/night-eater-crisis-twoshot.png",
        "alt": "震える声で「今夜いちばんの味だった」と囁かれる瞬間"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "night-eater.crisis.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "没収は、放送で始まった。「本日十九時、館内照明を全区画消灯します」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「夜間の暗がりは、在庫として回収します」——涼やかな声で。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "世界から、夜が没収された。黒い封筒は、真っ暗になったあとに届いた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会社は、彼女の夜を「在庫」として缶詰にする気だ。星も、蛍も、外套の暖かさも。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "全部まとめて「闇」一種類として。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "予行日の夜、作業員が照明を、区画ごとに落とし始めた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "安全灯まで、落とし始めた。現場責任者として、私は走った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "待ってください!　安全灯は消しちゃだめです、規則です!"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "　……それに、この暗闇、あなたたちのじゃない!"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "shake"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "区画の明かりが落ち、本物の真っ暗が来た。誰かの子どもが、売店の前で泣き出す声がした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会社の闇は、冷たくて、何の味もしない。——その時だった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "冷たい闇が、端から、静かに食べられていく。代わりに広がったのは、星のある夜だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "泣いていた子の頭上に、小さな星座がひとつ灯る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "あの人の夜は、泣いている子を、暗いままにしない。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……まずい闇。星もなし、風もなし、誰の思い出も入っていない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "星ゼロ。作り直しなさい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会社の闇に、史上最低評価が下った。でも彼女の声は、いつもより硬い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "通告書の控えには、次の予行日と、太字の一文。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「資産の抵抗は、資産価値の毀損とみなす」——と。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ミミ。……私、缶詰は嫌。でも、抵抗すればあなたの職場に迷惑が掛かる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "だから今夜は、たくさん食べて、どこか遠くの夜になろうかと——"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "だめです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "自分でも驚くくらい、はっきり出た。暗闇の中、彼女の外套の端を、ぎゅっとつかんでいた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "あなたの夜は、在庫じゃないです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.013b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.013b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "行灯の看取りの予約も、来年の品評会も、貸しっぱなしの外套の返却も、ぜんぶ、まだです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.013c",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.013c",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "予定のある夜を、勝手に缶詰にはさせません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.014a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.014a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "…………予定の、ある夜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "night-eater.crisis.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.016a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.016a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "暗闇の中、外套の内側に、そっと引き込まれた。真夏の夜の温度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.016b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.016b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳元の声は、少しだけ震えていた。それでも、いつものソムリエ口調に戻ろうとしていた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.direction.004",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "night-eater.crisis.asset.still.002"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.018a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.018a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……あなたの言葉、今夜いちばんの味だった。星五つ。……戦い方を、一緒に考えて。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.019a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.019a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "予行日は、次の試合の日と同じ。答えは、試合で見せるしかない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.line.019b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.crisis.line.019b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼女の夜が「在庫」じゃないことを、満員の会場で。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "night-eater.crisis.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "night-eater.crisis.choice.001",
          "label": "照明を一列ずつ食べ、影の進路を作る",
          "result": "試合当日、満員の会場で「本来の夜」を初めて公開した。頭上に星座、通路に蛍の道標、泣きそうな子の席には小さな月。会場は総立ち。見出しは「闘技場に、夜の名所誕生」——名所を缶詰にする稟議は、通らなかった。",
          "intent": "夜の価値を、隠さず全員に見せる",
          "promise": "危険を引き受け、この人専用の成長を最大まで進める。",
          "memory": "満員の会場が彼女の夜に拍手した日を、二人とも忘れない。",
          "tone": "wild",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "night-eater"
              },
              "mode": "add",
